[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2710405954","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103887#issuecomment-2710405954","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103887","id":2710405954,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hjYNC","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T12:22:51Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T12:22:51Z","body":"Looking into the GDScript docs this seems to be the expected behavior, in `method1` you're awaiting a signal (`await get_tree().create_timer(1.0).timeout`) which transforms `method1` in a coroutine, so `await callv(\"method1\", [])` will wait the function completion and return the signal object.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca7eac8c-0829-4877-9f45-7cccf37a13e7)\n\n<br>\n\nNow `method2` don't have any await inside his scope and the return result is a signal, in this case `await callv(\"method2\", [])` will evalute to `await result_signal` and wait the signal emission.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5431f23f-afed-47ee-b066-ed3f52c9963a)\n\n<br>\n\nSee more: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.html#awaiting-signals-or-coroutines","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2710405954/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2710451768","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103887#issuecomment-2710451768","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103887","id":2710451768,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hjjY4","user":{"login":"AdeelTariq","id":3908142,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDgxNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3908142?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdeelTariq","html_url":"https://github.com/AdeelTariq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdeelTariq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdeelTariq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdeelTariq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdeelTariq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdeelTariq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdeelTariq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdeelTariq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdeelTariq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdeelTariq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T12:39:59Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T12:39:59Z","body":"hmm feels counterintuitive but for future reference I changed my methods to await for `result_signal` instead of returning the signal to achieve the result I wanted.\n\n```gdscript\n\nfunc method1():\n\tprint(\"waiting for timeout\")\n\tawait get_tree().create_timer(1.0).timeout\n\tprint(\"timedout\")\n\tawait result_signal\n\n\nfunc method2():\n\tawait result_signal\n\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2710451768/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]